      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling trapped and unable to see a way out. Have you considered opening up gradually about your feelings to trusted people or seeking support from friends, family, or a mental health professional? Sometimes, small steps can help you feel more connected and less isolated.",
